WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:04,860
I'm so nice to be around

2
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:07,450
Shen Yuan, this idiot

3
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:09,310
I just lost such a big face at the dinner table

4
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:10,990
I must hate Song Yu to death now

5
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:12,890
I have to add fuel to the fire A Yuan

6
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:13,810
It's all my fault

7
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:15,490
If you didn't want to vent your anger on me

8
00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:18,330
She won't be forced to apologize in public.

9
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:20,230
Sister Qingxuan is timid to begin with

10
00:00:20,230 --> 00:00:22,130
Being stared at by so many people at the dinner table

11
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:24,030
It's normal not to dare to speak.

12
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:25,730
She is crying so sadly now

13
00:00:25,730 --> 00:00:27,230
all for me

14
00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:29,310
Stop crying. I don’t blame you.

15
00:00:29,310 --> 00:00:30,950
That woman is too scheming

16
00:00:30,950 --> 00:00:33,490
I really don’t know what kind of ecstasy candy was poured into my second brother by her.

17
00:00:33,530 --> 00:00:41,490
This was sent by the Crown Prince's wife.

18
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:43,290
Said it was a meeting gift for the girl
